  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chicken and dumplings brings instant comfort, with tender chicken simmered in a rich, savory broth scented with thyme and rosemary. Classic veggies, chicken stock, and a touch of garlic build cozy depth, while fluffy buttermilk dumplings cook up soft and pillowy, practically melting with each bite. Warm, simple, and deeply nostalgic, this easy recipe is perfect for chilly nights or sharing with friends when you want a bowl of pure homey goodness.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-chicken-and-dumplings\">Why You’ll Love This Chicken and Dumplings</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-chicken-and-dumplings\">How to Make Chicken and Dumplings</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-chicken-and-dumplings\">Pro Tips for Making Chicken and Dumplings</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-chicken-and-dumplings\">How to Serve this Chicken and Dumplings</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-chicken-and-dumplings\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Chicken and Dumplings</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s the ultimate comfort food that warms your soul.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with simple ingredients you probably have on hand.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for family gatherings or cozy nights in.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hearty and filling, it’s a meal that satisfies everyone.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite veggies for added flavor.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11817\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11817\" data-servings=\"6\"><div class=